#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid "Ghostscript Dependencies"
msgstr "Dependências do Ghostscript"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Recomendadas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:145
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"cups\"/> (required for building the <quote>cups</quote> "
"device backend, which is needed by <application>cups-filters</application>),"
" <xref linkend=\"fontconfig\"/> (required if you are installing any of the "
"suggested fonts), <xref linkend=\"freetype2\"/>, <xref linkend=\"lcms2\"/>, "
"<xref linkend=\"libjpeg\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libpng\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"tiff\"/>, and <xref linkend=\"openjpeg2\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"cups\"/> (exigido para construir a estrutura de retaguarda "
"do dispositivo <quote>cups</quote>, o qual é necessário para "
"<application>cups-filters</application>), <xref linkend=\"fontconfig\"/> "
"(exigido se você estiver instalando quaisquer das fontes sugeridas), <xref "
"linkend=\"freetype2\"/>, <xref linkend=\"lcms2\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libjpeg\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libpng\"/>, <xref linkend=\"tiff\"/> "
"e <xref linkend=\"openjpeg2\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:158
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opcionais"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:160
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"cairo\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libidn\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libpaper\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libwebp\"/>, and <xref linkend=\"x-window-system\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"cairo\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libidn\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libpaper\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libwebp\"/> e <xref linkend=\"x-window-system\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:171
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Ghostscript"
msgstr "Instalação do Ghostscript"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:175
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Ghostscript</application> build system is not user-"
"friendly. In order to use system copies of various graphics libraries, you "
"must do it using unconventional methods."
msgstr ""
"O sistema de construção do <application>Ghostscript</application> não é "
"amigável para o(a) usuário(a). Para a finalidade de usar cópias de sistema "
"de várias bibliotecas gráficas, você precisa fazer isso usando métodos não "
"convencionais."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:182
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Ghostscript</application> includes (old) copies of several "
"libraries. Some of these seem to have been patched to fix known "
"vulnerabilities, but others of these copies are less-well maintained.  To "
"ensure that any future fixes are applied throughout the whole system, it is "
"recommended that you first install the released versions of these libraries "
"and then configure <application>Ghostscript</application> to link to them."
msgstr ""
"<application>Ghostscript</application> inclui cópias (antigas) de diversas "
"bibliotecas. Algumas delas parecem ter sido remendadas para corrigir "
"vulnerabilidades conhecidas, mas outras dessas cópias são menos bem "
"mantidas. Para garantir que quaisquer correções futuras sejam aplicadas em "
"todo o sistema, é recomendado que você primeiro instale as versões lançadas "
"dessas bibliotecas e depois configure o "
"<application>Ghostscript</application> para se vincular a elas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have installed the recommended dependencies on your system, remove "
"the copies of <application>freetype</application>, "
"<application>lcms2</application>, <application>libjpeg</application>, "
"<application>libpng</application>, and <application>openjpeg</application>:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver instalado as dependências recomendadas em teu sistema, remova "
"as cópias de <application>freetype</application>, "
"<application>lcms2</application>, <application>libjpeg</application>, "
"<application>libpng</application> e <application>openjpeg</application>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:199
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>rm -rf freetype lcms2mt jpeg libpng openjpeg</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>rm -rf freetype lcms2mt jpeg libpng openjpeg</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:210
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile <application>Ghostscript</application>:"
msgstr "Compile o <application>Ghostscript</application>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:213
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>rm -rf zlib &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --disable-compile-inits \\\n"
"            --with-system-libtiff   \\\n"
"            CFLAGS=\"${CFLAGS:--g -O3} -fPIC\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>rm -rf zlib &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --disable-compile-inits \\\n"
"            --with-system-libtiff   \\\n"
"            CFLAGS=\"${CFLAGS:--g -O3} -fPIC\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:223
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The shared library depends on <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>. It is only used by "
"external programs like <xref linkend=\"asymptote\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"dvisvgm\"/>, and <xref linkend=\"imagemagick\"/>."
msgstr ""
"A biblioteca compartilhada depende do <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>. Ela é usada "
"somente por aplicativos externos, como <xref linkend=\"asymptote\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"dvisvgm\"/> e <xref linkend=\"imagemagick\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:230
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To compile the shared library <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libgs.so</filename>, run the following additional "
"command as an unprivileged user:"
msgstr ""
"Para compilar a biblioteca compartilhada <filename "
"class=\"libraryfile\">libgs.so</filename>, execute o seguinte comando "
"adicional como um(a) usuário(a) sem privilégios:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:235
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make so</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make so</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:238
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This package does not come with a test suite.  A set of example files may be"
" used for testing, but it is only possible after installation of the "
"package."
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste. Um conjunto de arquivos de "
"exemplo pode ser usado para testagem, mas isso é possível somente depois da "
"instalação do pacote."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:244
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:247
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:250
#, xml-text
msgid "If you built the shared library, install it with:"
msgstr "Se você construiu a biblioteca compartilhada, instale-a com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:253
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make soinstall                                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 base/*.h /usr/include/ghostscript &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfvn ghostscript /usr/include/ps</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make soinstall                                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 base/*.h /usr/include/ghostscript &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfvn ghostscript /usr/include/ps</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:258
#, xml-text
msgid "Now make the documentation accessible from a standard place:"
msgstr "Agora torne a documentação acessível a partir de um local padrão:"

#.  Starting with 9.23, the install does not seem to copy the examples any
#. more
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:262
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mv -v /usr/share/doc/ghostscript/&gs-version; /usr/share/doc/ghostscript-&gs-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"rmdir /usr/share/doc/ghostscript                                            &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -r examples/ -T /usr/share/ghostscript/&gs-version;/examples</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mv -v /usr/share/doc/ghostscript/&gs-version; /usr/share/doc/ghostscript-&gs-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"rmdir /usr/share/doc/ghostscript                                            &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -r examples/ -T /usr/share/ghostscript/&gs-version;/examples</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:267
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have downloaded the fonts, unpack them to <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/ghostscript</filename> and ensure the "
"ownership of the files are <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"
" <systemitem class=\"groupname\">root</systemitem>."
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver baixado as fontes, desempacote-as em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/ghostscript</filename> e certifique-se de que"
" a titularidade da propriedade dos arquivos seja <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>: <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">root</systemitem>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:274
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar -xvf ../ghostscript-fonts-std-8.11.tar.gz -C /usr/share/ghostscript --no-same-owner &amp;&amp;\n"
"tar -xvf ../gnu-gs-fonts-other-6.0.tar.gz     -C /usr/share/ghostscript --no-same-owner &amp;&amp;\n"
"fc-cache -v /usr/share/ghostscript/fonts/</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar -xvf ../ghostscript-fonts-std-8.11.tar.gz -C /usr/share/ghostscript --no-same-owner &amp;&amp;\n"
"tar -xvf ../gnu-gs-fonts-other-6.0.tar.gz     -C /usr/share/ghostscript --no-same-owner &amp;&amp;\n"
"fc-cache -v /usr/share/ghostscript/fonts/</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:279
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You can now test the rendering of various postscript and pdf files from the "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/share/ghostscript/&gs-version;/examples "
"</filename>. To do this, run the following command (in a X11 session):"
msgstr ""
"Você pode agora testar a renderização de vários arquivos PostScript e PDF a "
"partir de <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/share/ghostscript/&gs-"
"version;/examples </filename>. Para fazer isso, execute o seguinte comando "
"(em uma sessão do X11):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:284
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>gs -q -dBATCH /usr/share/ghostscript/&gs-"
"version;/examples/tiger.eps</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>gs -q -dBATCH /usr/share/ghostscript/&gs-"
"version;/examples/tiger.eps</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:289
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:292
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>rm -rf zlib </command>: <application>zlib</application> was "
"installed as part of LFS."
msgstr ""
"<command>rm -rf zlib </command>: <application>zlib</application> foi "
"instalado como parte do LFS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:297
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-compile-inits</parameter>: This option makes "
"<command>gs</command> and <filename>libgs.so</filename> slightly smaller."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-compile-inits</parameter>: Essa opção torna "
"<command>gs</command> e <filename>libgs.so</filename> ligeiramente menores."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:302
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-system-libtiff</parameter>: Remove this option if you've "
"not installed <xref linkend=\"tiff\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-system-libtiff</parameter>: Remova essa opção se você não "
"tiver instalado o <xref linkend=\"tiff\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:307
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>CFLAGS=\"${CFLAGS:--g -O3} -fPIC\"</parameter>: These flags are "
"needed to prevent a linker error during the build process."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>CFLAGS=\"${CFLAGS:--g -O3} -fPIC\"</parameter>: Esses "
"sinalizadores são necessários para evitar um erro do vinculador durante o "
"processo de construção."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:312
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>install -v -m644 base/*.h... </command>: Some packages "
"(<application>ImageMagick</application> is one) need the "
"<application>Ghostscript</application> interface headers in place to link to"
" the shared library. These commands install the headers."
msgstr ""
"<command>install -v -m644 base/*.h... </command>: Alguns pacotes "
"(<application>ImageMagick</application> é um) precisam dos cabeçalhos de "
"interface do <application>Ghostscript</application> no lugar para se "
"vincularem com a biblioteca compartilhada. Esses comandos instalam os "
"cabeçalhos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:319
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>ln -sfvn ghostscript /usr/include/ps</command>: Some packages "
"expect to find the interface headers in an alternate location."
msgstr ""
"<command>ln -sfvn ghostscript /usr/include/ps</command>: Alguns pacotes "
"esperam encontrar os cabeçalhos da interface em um local alternativo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:324
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>mv -v /usr/share/doc/ghostscript/&gs-version; "
"/usr/share/doc/ghostscript-&gs-version;</command>: This moves the "
"documentation to where it is expected to be found."
msgstr ""
"<command>mv -v /usr/share/doc/ghostscript/&gs-version; "
"/usr/share/doc/ghostscript-&gs-version;</command>: Isso move a documentação "
"para onde ela é esperada ser encontrada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/gs.xml:330
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-cups</option>: This option will save a tiny amount of "
"space by not linking <command>gs</command> and <filename>libgs.so</filename>"
" to the <xref linkend=\"cups\"/> libraries if you have installed those."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-cups</option>: Essa opção economizará uma pequena "
"quantidade de espaço ao não vincular <command>gs</command> e "
"<filename>libgs.so</filename> às bibliotecas do <xref linkend=\"cups\"/> se "
"você as tiver instalado."

